# Firebase 注意事項

僅當專案**已使用 Firebase** 時套用。不要為了本檔把非 Firebase 專案改成 Firestore／Hosting。

## Firestore 操作

- 將 Firestore 操作封裝在專案既有的服務層（常見 `services/` 或 `lib/`），不要為了本檔新建目錄
- 使用 TypeScript 泛型確保資料型別安全
- 實作錯誤處理與重試機制

```typescript
// services/userService.ts
import { doc, getDoc, setDoc } from 'firebase/firestore';
import { db } from '@/lib/firebase';
import type { UserProfile } from '@/types';

export const userService = {
  async getById(userId: string): Promise<UserProfile | null> {
    const docRef = doc(db, 'users', userId);
    const docSnap = await getDoc(docRef);
    return docSnap.exists() ? (docSnap.data() as UserProfile) : null;
  },

  async update(userId: string, data: Partial<UserProfile>): Promise<void> {
    const docRef = doc(db, 'users', userId);
    await setDoc(docRef, data, { merge: true });
  },
};
```

## 安全規則

- 所有 Firestore 集合必須有對應的安全規則
- 敏感操作需驗證使用者身份與權限

## 錯誤處理

```typescript
// utils/errors.ts
export class AppError extends Error {
  constructor(
    message: string,
    public code: string,
    public statusCode?: number
  ) {
    super(message);
    this.name = 'AppError';
  }
}

export class ValidationError extends AppError {
  constructor(message: string) {
    super(message, 'VALIDATION_ERROR', 400);
  }
}
```

## Firebase Hosting 快取配置

```json
{
  "hosting": {
    "headers": [
      {
        "source": "**/*.@(js|css)",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
      },
      {
        "source": "**/*.@(jpg|jpeg|png|gif|webp|svg)",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }]
      },
      {
        "source": "**/*.html",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
